Manage IP groups and their permissions.

Usage:
  confluent iam ip-group [command]

Available Commands:
  create      Create an IAM IP group.
  delete      Delete one or more IAM IP groups.
  describe    Describe an IAM IP group.
  list        List IAM IP groups.
  update      Update an existing IAM IP group.

Global Flags:
  -h, --help            Show help for this command.
      --unsafe-trace    Equivalent to -vvvv, but also log HTTP requests and responses which might contain plaintext secrets.
  -v, --verbose count   Increase verbosity (-v for warn, -vv for info, -vvv for debug, -vvvv for trace).

Use "confluent iam ip-group [command] --help" for more information about a command.
